WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.867
"Cat must go!" the king cried.

2
00:00:08.868 --> 00:00:11.554
"We can't have fleas in the castle!"

3
00:00:11.555 --> 00:00:14.184
Dirk had a wicked smile.

4
00:00:14.185 --> 00:00:17.410
"I'll get rid of Cat," he said.

5
00:00:17.411 --> 00:00:21.472
Cat hissed loudly.

6
00:00:21.473 --> 00:00:23.642
The queen looked at Tom.

7
00:00:23.643 --> 00:00:27.172
"Tom is not scratching," she said.

8
00:00:27.173 --> 00:00:30.461
"So the fleas are not coming from Cat."

9
00:00:30.462 --> 00:00:36.539
Prince Eric scratched. "I'm so itchy!"

10
00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:39.288
"Maybe I can help," Tom said.

11
00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:41.389
He waved his wand.

12
00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:45.859
"Stop scratching!" he cried.

13
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:49.946
Everybody's hands froze.

14
00:00:49.947 --> 00:00:52.617
The scratching stopped.

15
00:00:52.618 --> 00:00:56.274
But the itching didn't stop.

16
00:00:56.275 --> 00:00:59.996
"This is worse than before!" the king cried.

17
00:00:59.997 --> 00:01:02.917
"Oops," Tom said.

18
00:01:02.918 --> 00:01:06.949
"We must get rid of the fleas," the queen said.

19
00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:12.602
"Let's clean the castle!"

20
00:01:12.603 --> 00:01:20.543
Servants brought buckets of soap and water.

21
00:01:20.544 --> 00:01:26.428
They scrubbed all the floors and walls.

22
00:01:26.429 --> 00:01:32.638
They scrubbed the thrones.

23
00:01:32.639 --> 00:01:38.245
"Now everybody takes a bath!" the queen said.

24
00:01:38.246 --> 00:01:41.522
"It's Monday," the king said.

25
00:01:41.523 --> 00:01:45.278
"We take baths on Saturday," Dirk said.

26
00:01:45.279 --> 00:01:47.931
The queen frowned.

27
00:01:47.932 --> 00:01:53.481
Everybody went to take a bath.

28
00:01:53.482 --> 00:02:00.723
The next morning the castle was spotless.

29
00:02:00.724 --> 00:02:06.819
"The fleas have fled!" the king said.

30
00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:12.511
But soon the king's feet itched.

31
00:02:12.512 --> 00:02:15.604
Dirk's neck itched.

32
00:02:15.605 --> 00:02:18.266
Dirk glared at Tom.

33
00:02:18.267 --> 00:02:22.195
Only Tom was not scratching.

34
00:02:22.196 --> 00:02:25.979
"I know that Cat has fleas," Dirk thought.

35
00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:35.254
"But somehow she's protecting Tom."

